Working Tree
------------
- Only on your computer → nobody else can see it.
- The set of actual files and folders you work on in your project.
- Example:
    myproject/
    ├── file1.txt   ← working tree file
    ├── main.c      ← working tree file
    └── .git/       ← local repository (hidden folder)

- Working tree = file1.txt, main.c, etc. (normal editable files)
- `.git/` = Git’s storage (commits, branches, history)

Creating a Working Tree
-----------------------
cd learning
git init

Result:
learning/
└── .git/   ← local repository storage
(Now `learning` is your working tree)



Basic Git Workflow
------------------

1️⃣ Add some files
    echo "Hello Git" > readme.txt
    (Now `readme.txt` is in your working tree, but Git isn’t tracking it yet.)

2️⃣ Check the status
    git status
    Output example:
        Untracked files:
          readme.txt
    (Git sees the file but hasn’t started tracking it.)

3️⃣ Stage the file (add to staging area)
    git add readme.txt
    (Now `readme.txt` is in the staging area — ready to be committed.)

4️⃣ Commit to the local repository
    git commit -m "Add readme file"
    (Snapshot is now stored in your local repository inside `.git/`.)

5️⃣ (Optional) Link to a remote repository
    git remote add origin https://github.com/user/learning.git
    git push -u origin main
    
    
 Flow:
Working Tree → (git add) → Staging Area → (git commit) → Local Repo → (git push) → Remote Repo
          ┌───────────────────────────────┐
          │        Remote Repository      │
          │ (GitHub, GitLab, Bitbucket)   │
          └──────────────▲────────────────┘
                         │  git push / git pull
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
                         │
          ┌──────────────┴────────────────┐
          │       Local Repository        │
          │     (.git folder in project)  │
          │ - Stores commits, branches    │
          │ - Private until pushed        │
          └──────────────▲────────────────┘
                         │ git commit
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
                         │
          ┌──────────────┴────────────────┐
          │        Staging Area           │
          │    (a.k.a. Index)             │
          │ - Temporary holding area      │
          │ - Add files with `git add`    │
          └──────────────▲────────────────┘
                         │ git add
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
                         │
          ┌──────────────┴────────────────┐
          │         Working Tree          │
          │ - Your actual files/folders   │
          │ - Edit here                   │
          │ - Changes are private         │
          └───────────────────────────────┘


